        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Elisha alikuwa amemwambia yule mwanamke, ambaye alimfufulia mwanawe, akasema, Ondoka, ukaende wewe na jamaa yako, ukae hali ya kigeni utakakoweza kukaa; kwa sababu BWANA ameiita njaa; nayo itakuja juu ya nchi hii muda wa miaka saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaondoka yule mwanamke, akafanya kama alivyosema mtu wa Mungu; akaenda, yeye na jamaa yake, akakaa katika nchi ya Wafilisti miaka saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa miaka saba ilipoisha, yule mwanamke akarudi kutoka nchi ya Wafilisti; akatokea amlilie mfalme kwa ajili ya nyumba yake na shamba lake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.5.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Fal 5:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi mfalme alikuwa akizungumza na Gehazi, mtumishi wa mtu wa Mungu, akinena, Uniambie, nakusihi, mambo makuu yote aliyoyafanya Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Fal 4:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa, alipokuwa katika kumwambia mfalme jinsi alivyomfufua mtu aliyekufa, tazama, huyo mwanamke aliyemfufulia mwanawe, alimlilia mfalme kwa ajili ya nyumba yake na shamba lake. Gehazi akasema, Bwana wangu mfalme, huyu ndiye mwanamke, na huyu ndiye mwanawe, ambaye Elisha alimfufua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mfalme alipomwuliza yule mwanamke, yeye akamweleza. Basi mfalme akamtolea akida, akasema, Mrudishie yote aliyokuwa nayo, na mapato yote ya shamba lake tangu siku aliposafiri, hata leo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
