                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme akamwambia Hazaeli, Chukua zawadi mkononi mwako, ukaende ili kumlaki yule mtu wa Mungu, ukamwulize BWANA kwa kinywa chake, kusema, Je! Nitapona ugonjwa huu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Hazaeli akaenda kumlaki, akachukua zawadi mkononi mwake, za kila kitu chema kilichopatikana Dameski, kiasi cha mizigo ya ngamia arobaini, akaenda, akasimama mbele yake akasema, Mwana wako Ben-hadadi, mfalme wa Shamu, amenituma kwako, kusema, Je nitapona ugonjwa huu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha akamwambia, Enenda, ukamwambie, Bila shaka utapona; lakini BWANA amenionyesha ya kwamba bila shaka atakufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
