        },
        {
          "text": "Hazaeli akasema, Bwana wangu analilia nini? Akajibu, Kwa sababu nayajua mabaya utakayowatenda wana wa Israeli; utazichoma moto ngome zao, utawaua vijana wao kwa upanga, utawaseta-seta watoto wao wachanga na wanawake wao wenye mimba utawapasua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
