            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazaeli akasema, Lakini mimi mtumwa wako ni nani, mimi niliye mbwa tu, hata nifanye jambo hili kubwa? Elisha akajibu, BWANA amenionyesha ya kwamba wewe utakuwa mfalme juu ya Shamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo akamwacha Elisha, akarudi kwa bwana wake; naye akamwambia, Elisha alikuambiaje? Akajibu, Aliniambia ya kuwa bila shaka utapona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa siku ya pili yake, akatwaa tandiko la kitanda, akalichovya katika maji, akalitandaza juu ya uso wake, hata akafa. Na Hazaeli akatawala badala yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.15"
            ]
