              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi akaenda Yehoramu mpaka Sairi, na magari yake yote pamoja naye. Akaondoka usiku, akawapiga Waedomi waliomzunguka yeye na maakida wa magari; na watu wakakimbilia hemani kwao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.21",
